Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty-Third Episode\NThe Phantom Knight\NThe Ribbon Knight Appears
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.94,0:02:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now, before we begin today's story, let us recap last week's events.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.45,0:02:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}One night, the King went missing and was presumed dead,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.60,0:02:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so Sapphire was set\Nto ascend the throne.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.43,0:02:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.20,0:02:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}amid the grand celebration, the Queen fell victim to the evil scheme of{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.04,0:02:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Grand Duke Duralumin and Lord Nylon\Nand was tricked into drinking poison.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.27,0:02:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh no!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.56,0:02:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This poison forces whoever drinks it to reveal all the secrets in their heart.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.34,0:02:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh how lovely!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.24,0:02:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In front of the kingdom's representatives and{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.56,0:02:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}foreign dignitaries, the Queen blabbed Sapphire's secret—{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.91,0:02:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}yes, the secret that Sapphire is actually a girl, not a boy.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.16,0:02:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}For the crime of deceiving the people, Sapphire and the Queen{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.72,0:02:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}were sentenced to life imprisonment\Nin{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.68,0:02:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the terrifying prison known as the Coffin Tower.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.40,0:02:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What fate lies in store for Sapphire and the Queen?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.39,0:03:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please enjoy today's episode.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.26,0:03:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Gama, jailer of the tower! Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.48,0:03:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, right away, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.92,0:03:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.68,0:04:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay strong... Hang in there, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.86,0:04:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let Sapphire and the Queen out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.83,0:04:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.27,0:04:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.70,0:04:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Prince Sapphire and the Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.18,0:04:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Gama, I leave them in your care.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.02,0:04:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.50,0:04:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir. Thank you for your hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.83,0:04:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.50,0:04:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a dreadful tower this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.58,0:04:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Right this way, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.96,0:04:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that noise, Gama?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.69,0:04:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.60,0:05:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If that frightens you, you won't last long in the Coffin Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.72,0:05:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is our room?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.87,0:05:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, just up those stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.21,0:05:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, bats!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.66,0:05:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that scared me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.02,0:05:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There sure are all kinds of things in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.42,0:05:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.43,0:05:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the room for the two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.41,0:05:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Are there no beds in this room?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.61,0:05:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Beds?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.23,0:05:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Men, get two beds ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.30,0:05:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.12,0:05:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all my men.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.34,0:05:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me that jewel in exchange for beds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.38,0:05:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but this is a precious keepsake of the King...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.59,0:05:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, looks like they don't need beds after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.89,0:06:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Huddle up and sleep on the stones, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.00,0:06:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Gama—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.67,0:06:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.70,0:06:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.06,0:06:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.94,0:06:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Men, bring in the beds!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.08,0:06:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Could we have some light in the room?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.23,0:06:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Men, bring a light!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.95,0:06:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,In payment for the candles, give me that brooch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.67,0:06:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.99,0:06:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough of your greed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.73,0:06:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, looks like they don't need light after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.06,0:06:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.31,0:06:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no choice...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.93,0:06:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already been three days since we came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.42,0:06:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, you must be hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.90,0:06:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't eaten anything since breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.45,0:07:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do about dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.57,0:07:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like some, but we've run out of necklaces and rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.32,0:07:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you two still have those fine clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.92,0:07:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If I give you these, could we get something else to wear?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.00,0:07:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. Something very fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.98,0:07:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.11,0:07:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.46,0:07:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mother... wearing clothes like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.01,0:07:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we have no need for fine dresses anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.70,0:07:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, grub's ready! Come on, eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.37,0:07:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, after trading off our fine clothes, this is all we get?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.15,0:07:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could at least let Sapphire eat her fill.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.68,0:07:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll take a few more jewels or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.07,0:07:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.63,0:07:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you hiding something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.86,0:07:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No, really, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.21,0:07:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing here. Nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.34,0:07:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the mother does the laundry, and the kid cleans the house!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.38,0:07:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.16,0:07:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Making Mother work?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.32,0:08:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.66,0:08:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna work you two to the bone today!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.50,0:08:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't we energetic...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.99,0:08:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Gama's cruelty doesn't bother me at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.20,0:08:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather work than sit around moping.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.34,0:08:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, keeping busy makes me feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.77,0:08:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Gama!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.48,0:08:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You washed my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.64,0:08:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.14,0:08:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Less talking, more working!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.96,0:08:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting hit and then stuck with trash duty? Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.21,0:08:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see, the trash dump is... Ah, right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.55,0:09:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Who's there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.92,0:09:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, this was Gama's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.82,0:09:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Make a fool of Master Gama again, and you won't get off easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.27,0:09:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know it was your room, Gama!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.98,0:09:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No food for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.46,0:09:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Scrub the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.13,0:09:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you get it...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.06,0:09:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.30,0:09:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see, a rag, a rag...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.33,0:09:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, this one!
